Construction Innovation Expo 2026 | Explore Frontline of the Industry at Main Stage

📅 Date: 23 – 25 November 2026 (Monday – Wednesday)
📍 Exhibition Venue: Hall 1C - E, Hong Kong Convention and Exhibition Centre (Main stage is located at Hall 1C)

We are honoured to invite industry leading companies and exhibitors to share their pioneering smart solutions with the firsthand experience of site adoption on the Main Stage.

Let’s have a glance of the highlights of the Main Stage sessions:

💡 World leading client, consultant and contractor companies sharing their most recent experience in applying innovation technologies

* Sponsor Spotlight Sessions – sharing the most recent project deliverables and the roadmap towards the future of construction in Hong Kong

💡 Panel Discussion on the most up-to-date topic for sparking new insights

* Discussion on Driving Sustainable Construction in Hong Kong
* Explore the Loop Hong Kong Park and its development in adopting AI and robot

💡 Startups sharing their innovative ideas in transforming build environmen

* Several Startup companies from Cyberport and HKSTP showcase their most inspiring technologies for the next generation of the industry

Register for the CIExpo2026 to join the Main Stage at the Exhibition Hall 1C - explore the most advanced global innovative solutions and how are they enhancing the productivity, safety and sustainability in the local industry!
More Details on CIExpo 2026: https://ciexpo.cic.hk/event/2026/home

(The Main Stage livestream will also be available to all registered attendees during the show period.)

